# 🛒 Amazon Product Price Prediction

A Machine Learning project that predicts the **actual price of Amazon products** based on features like discount, rating, rating count, and product category.

---

## 🚀 Project Overview

This project uses a **Machine Learning Regression model (Random Forest / Linear Regression)** to estimate the original price of a product using:

- Discounted Price  
- Discount Percentage  
- Rating  
- Rating Count  
- Product Category (Encoded)

The model helps understand pricing patterns in e-commerce data.

---

## 📊 Dataset

The dataset contains Amazon product information including:

- Product category hierarchy  
- Discounted price  
- Actual price (Target variable)  
- Rating and rating count  
- Other product metadata  

---

## 🧠 Machine Learning Workflow

1. Data Cleaning & Preprocessing  
2. Handling Missing Values  
3. Label Encoding / One-Hot Encoding  
4. Feature Selection  
5. Model Training  
6. Model Evaluation  

---

## 🤖 Models Used

- Linear Regression  
- Decision Tree Regressor  
- KNN Regressor  
- Random Forest Regressor  
- XGBoost Regressor  

---

## 🏆 Best Model Performance

- Random Forest Regressor achieved best accuracy (~95%)

---

## 📦 Tech Stack

- Python 🐍  
- Pandas & NumPy  
- Scikit-learn  
- XGBoost  
- Streamlit (Frontend UI)  
- FastAPI (Backend API)  
- Joblib (Model Saving)

---

## 🖥️ Streamlit App Features

- Select Product Category  
- Enter Discounted Price  
- Enter Discount Percentage  
- Enter Rating & Rating Count  
- Get Instant Price Prediction  

